  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "第四天晚上，整座山姆突然黑了。",
      "characters": 13,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 78,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "我第一反应是冷库。",
      "characters": 8,
      "start_frame": 78,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 126,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "许棠已经戴上头灯，先让我别开冷库门。",
      "characters": 16,
      "start_frame": 126,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 222,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "窗外，整条街的灯也灭了。",
      "characters": 10,
      "start_frame": 222,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 282,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "我们按事先列好的清单，保留监控、通信和一间冷库。",
      "characters": 21,
      "start_frame": 282,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 408,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "备用发电机启动了。",
      "characters": 8,
      "start_frame": 408,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 456,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "灯重新亮起来时，我刚松了一口气。",
      "characters": 14,
      "start_frame": 456,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 540,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "许棠却让我去看停车场。",
      "characters": 10,
      "start_frame": 540,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 600,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "刚才还散着的人影，正往设备间这边走。",
      "characters": 16,
      "start_frame": 600,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 696,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "城市安静下来以后，机器的声音传得格外远。",
      "characters": 18,
      "start_frame": 696,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 804,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "我们有吃的，有水，也有油。",
      "characters": 10,
      "start_frame": 804,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 864,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "可每用一会儿电，门外就多几张脸。",
      "characters": 14,
      "start_frame": 864,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 948,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "我把用电清单摊在桌上，许棠把冷库记录放到旁边。",
      "characters": 21,
      "start_frame": 948,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1074,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "我们得重新安排机器的运行，既省油，也少暴露自己。",
      "characters": 21,
      "start_frame": 1074,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1200,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "我抬头看监控。",
      "characters": 6,
      "start_frame": 1200,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1236,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "停车场最远处，又有一片人影转向了我们。",
      "characters": 17,
      "start_frame": 1236,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1338,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    }
  ],
  "script_sha256": "7a5f96b0c92d363aa4de114cfc2368ce3c61e68dfa074bbe8cf5e4721989fc54",
  "assets": {
